B.Z8=new A.al("lay_on_hands","Lay on Hands","[Action]: Target an Ally within range 1. You may lose HP up to {2 * Source}, and heal the target for twice that amount. Targeted Ally also gains {Source d12} Shield if you lose at least {Source} HP.\n\n[Reaction]: During ally turns when the ally is within range 1, spend your reaction and trigger your Lay on Hands.",B.ax,B.a9A,!1)
