B.ZS=new A.al("feature_lightning","Lightning","[Action] Make a Melee Attack vs Dex targeting an enemy range 3. On success, target another enemy range 3 of that enemy. Repeat targeting enemies range 3 of the last target, never targeting an enemy more than once until out of targets. Deal {Source d6} damage to all targets and knock the targets prone.\n\n[Reaction] When you or an ally range 4 succeed on an Attack during their turn, Spend your reaction and target all of the targets of the triggering attack, deal {Half Source d6} + 1d6 for each enemy targeted beyond the first and knock them prone.",B.I,B.acK,!1)
