B.ZC=new A.al("feature_shadow_dancer","Shadow Dancer","Shadow Dance [Reaction] During your turn, If you are within 1 space of a creature, spend your reaction and you may teleport up to {2* Source}, to a Free Space adjacent to a creature. You may not teleport above a creature.\n\n[Reaction] End of any Turn if there is a character within 1 of you, spend your reaction and teleport up to {2* Source} to a free space adjacent to a creature. You may not Teleport above a creature.\n",B.ax,B.aaM,!1)
