B.Z6=new A.al("feature_snuff_out","Snuff Out","[Action] make a melee attack vs Dex targeting 1 enemy range 5 with burn. On Success, deal {Source d8}, and have the target roll and take their burn damage then end their burn. \n\n[Reaction] When an enemy range 3 rolls burn dice, Spend your Reaction and the target rolls their burn again and also takes {Half Source d6}, Then end the burn.",B.I,B.aaQ,!1)
