B.WB=new A.q("feature_upgrade_armor_Power_Armor","Power Armor","While concentrating, Each round, the target may gain resistance to the damage from an attack up to {Half Source} times.")
B.aaV=s([B.Wr,B.Tf,B.WB],t.U)
B.Zf=new A.al("feature_upgrade_armor","Upgrade Armor","[Reaction] During your turn or when an ally becomes adjacent to you, Spend your reaction and Target {Half Source} creature without upgraded armor range 1. As long as you remain concentrating, they gain a +1 bonus to defense results. While concentrating, if you activate the ability again, you may add the new targets to your current concentration.\n\n[Reaction] Start of a Combat Situation when you were not surprised, you may spend your reaction and give up to {Half Source} Creatures on your team your upgraded armor, and you begin concentrating on your upgraded armor. You do not regain your reaction on your first turn.\n",B.ax,B.aaV,!1)
