B.XW=new A.q("feature_upgrade_attacks_Magical","Magical","The targets may choose to have their attacks target Int, Wis, or Cha defense instead. If they do, they deal 1d12 extra damage.")
B.a9r=s([B.Tm,B.XW],t.U)
B.ZU=new A.al("feature_upgrade_attacks","Upgrade Attacks","[Reaction] During your turn or when an ally becomes adjacent to you, Spend your reaction and Target {Half Source} creatures with unupgraded attacks Range 1. As long as you remain concentrating, they gain a +1 to attack results and deal {Half Source d6} extra damage on success. While concentrating, if you activate the ability again, you may add the new targets to your current concentration.\n\n[Reaction] Start of a Combat Situation when you were not surprised, you may spend your reaction and give up to {Half Source} Creatures on your team your Attack upgrade, and you begin concentrating on your upgraded attacks. You do not regain your reaction on your first turn.\n",B.ax,B.a9r,!1)
B.UW=new A.q("feature_vow_My_Valor","My Valor","While concentrating, If the target is within {Source} of you, they have +1 to attack results.")
